<Slide style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 1280, height: 720, background: 'linear-gradient(165deg, #15203A 0%, #070B14 58%, #0B1124 100%)', position: 'relative', padding: '52px 56px 0 56px' }}>
  <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', position: 'absolute', top: -180, right: -140, width: 560, height: 560, background: 'radial-gradient(circle, rgba(34,211,238,0.2) 0%, rgba(34,211,238,0) 70%)' }} />
  <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', position: 'absolute', top: 52, right: 56 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>03 · 商业</Text>
  </Box>
  <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>2,000 万买什么：已建成的平台，和它未来 12 个月的增长</Text>
  <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 1168, height: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.14)', marginTop: 16 }} />
  <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', marginTop: 30, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 92, fontWeight: 'bold', color: 'transparent', backgroundImage: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #22D3EE 0%, #818CF8 100%)', backgroundClip: 'text' }}>2,000<span style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF' }}> 万元</span></Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 20, color: '#94A3B8' }}>15% 股权 · 投前估值 1.13 亿 · 产品风险已出清，资金只买增长</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 4 }}>定价三锚：① 重建成本 3,000 万—9,000 万的 1.3—3.8 倍 ② 国际 AI 种子轮中位 1.4—1.6 亿（Carta 2026），我们 1.33 亿 post 低于中位 ③ 下轮 10 倍回报倒推（机构天使标准）</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', marginTop: 34, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 23, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>资金用途</Text>
    <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 140, fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>市场推广</Text>
      <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 500, height: 26, borderRadius: 14, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)' }}><Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 250, height: 26, borderRadius: 14, backgroundImage: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #22D3EE 0%, #818CF8 100%)', boxShadow: '0 0 20px rgba(34,211,238,0.5)' }} /></Box>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 21, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>50%</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 140, fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>技术开发</Text>
      <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 500, height: 26, borderRadius: 14, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)' }}><Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 175, height: 26, borderRadius: 14, background: '#22D3EE' }} /></Box>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 21, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>35%</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 140, fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>运营成本</Text>
      <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 500, height: 26, borderRadius: 14, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)' }}><Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 50, height: 26, borderRadius: 14, background: '#818CF8' }} /></Box>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 21, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>10%</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 140, fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>预留资金</Text>
      <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 500, height: 26, borderRadius: 14, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)' }}><Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 25, height: 26, borderRadius: 14, background: '#94A3B8' }} /></Box>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 21, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>5%</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', marginTop: 10 }}>1,000 万市场费 → 80 万新增用户 · 700 万研发 → 企业版 + 模型扩容 · 200 万运营 → 组建 10 人核心团队 · 100 万预留</Text>
  <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', marginTop: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
    <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 350, height: 72, borderRadius: 14, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22)', boxShadow: '0 12px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.55)', justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 20 }}><Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.4 }}><span style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2026 本轮</span><br />流量引爆 · 占领 30% 细分</Text></Box>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 26, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>→</Text>
    <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 350, height: 72, borderRadius: 14, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22)', boxShadow: '0 12px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.55)', justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 20 }}><Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.4 }}><span style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2027</span><br />A—D 轮 · 国内外扩张</Text></Box>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 26, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>→</Text>
    <Box style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', width: 350, height: 72, borderRadius: 14, backgroundImage: 'linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34,211,238,0.25) 0%, rgba(129,140,248,0.25) 100%)', border: '1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.6)', boxShadow: '0 12px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.55)', justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 20 }}><Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 19, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.4 }}><span style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>2032</span><br />应用层头部 · IPO 路径</Text></Box>
  </Box>
